{"study_accession":"PRJNA738893","secondary_study_accession":"SRP324511","title":"CircRNA sequencing in peripheral blood mononuclear cells from Ankylosing Spondylitis patients and healthy controls","description":"To identify the expression profiles of circRNAs in peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) from Ankylosing Spondylitis (AS) patients and healthy controls, we used circRNA sequencing to detect circRNA in 3 samples of PBMCs from AS patients and 3 samples of PBMCs from healthy controls. In brief, total RNA was extracted and purified using Magen Hipure Total RNA Mini Kit (Magen, Guangzhou, China), followed by constructing RNA sequencing libraries with KAPA RNA HyperPrep Kit with RiboErase (Kapa Biosystems, Inc., MA, USA). After the construction of RNA sequencing libraries, Qubit 3.0 fluorometer (Invitrogen, CA, USA) and the Agilent 2100 bioanalyzer (Applied Biosystems, CA, USA) were used for quality control. Then, the PE150 mode of HiSeq X10 (Illumina Inc., CA, USA) was used for sequencing. Differentially expressed circRNAs were screened with criteria of fold-change>1.5 and p<0.05. Overall design: CircRNAs expression profiles of peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) from Ankylosing Spondylitis (AS) patients and healthy controls","pubmed":"34977002","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN19763696","study_accession":"PRJNA738893","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"94","description":"94","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5390431","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":2,"first_public":"2022-01-07","attributes":[["source_name","peripheral blood mononuclear cells"],["tissue","peripheral blood mononuclear cells"],["age","30"],["group","Ankylosing Spondylitis (AS)"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR14854360","experiment_accession":"SRX11172883","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":23879955,"base_count":7163986500,"first_public":"2022-01-07","experiment_title":"I